---
Checks: >
  -*,
  bugprone-*,
  performance-*,
  modernize-*,
  -modernize-use-trailing-return-type,
  -modernize-use-nodiscard
WarningsAsErrors: ''
HeaderFilterRegex: '^(include|src|tests|benchmarks)/.*'
FormatStyle: file
CheckOptions:
  modernize-use-auto.MinTypeNameLength: '5'

# The two excluded modernize checks are initially too policy-heavy for M0:
# trailing return types are not a project convention, and nodiscard should be
# applied from API semantics rather than inferred wholesale. This selection
# will be reviewed against real code during later milestones.
...
